Package: zulmclient
Version: 0.0.1
Title: Test Fixture for the 'zulm' C Table
Description: Built by tests/testthat/test-c-table.R to drive 'zulm' from C
    the way 'zuflow' and 'zukzeit' do. A real package declares
    'LinkingTo: zulm' and 'Imports: zulm'; this fixture gets the header
    path from the test instead, so it also builds under devtools::test().
